    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as <strong>Camellia</strong>, a <strong>nonconventional princess</strong>, heiress to the throne, who has to fulfill multitude obligations, due to her rank.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Camelia evolves in <strong>two dimensions</strong>: <br>the world of her <strong>Palace</strong>, and the <strong>ethereal world</strong> that can be accessed by practicing\u00a0<strong>\u201cDerivation\u201d</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u201cDerivation\u201d is a kind\u00a0of meditation</strong>,\u00a0which helps her solve problems when\u00a0she returns to the real world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The meditation is\u00a0a <strong>side scrolling\u00a0action game</strong>,\u00a0where <strong>levels</strong>, <strong>weapons</strong> and <strong>enemies</strong> are <strong>procedurally generated</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1763220/extras/f8ed2cae44fe4e7b3e681707a5e1042b.poster.avif?t=1746567941\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1763220/extras/f8ed2cae44fe4e7b3e681707a5e1042b.webm?t=1746567941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1763220/extras/f8ed2cae44fe4e7b3e681707a5e1042b.mp4?t=1746567941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1763220/extras/bad1fdace45744e580e992bd5896ec67.poster.avif?t=1746567941\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1763220/extras/bad1fdace45744e580e992bd5896ec67.webm?t=1746567941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1763220/extras/bad1fdace45744e580e992bd5896ec67.mp4?t=1746567941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An innovative concept where you battle monsters in your <strong>Derivation</strong> to deepen your relationships and overcome obstacles in real life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Run</strong>, <strong>Jump</strong>, <strong>Punch</strong>, <strong>Divekick</strong>, <strong>Super.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1763220/extras/71a9da7127c0abad9c19990e045339b6.poster.avif?t=1746567941\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1763220/extras/71a9da7127c0abad9c19990e045339b6.webm?t=1746567941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1763220/extras/71a9da7127c0abad9c19990e045339b6.mp4?t=1746567941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pickup new <strong>procedurally generated weapons</strong> every run.\u00a0Beware, if you get hit, you lose your weapon, it may never reappear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1763220/extras/50b3475e671f5cd840e189b86dac326c.avif?t=1746567941\" /></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Combo System</strong>:\u00a0Chain actions and take risks to reap more rewards. <br>  <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1763220/extras/acc5ad3421b2d8b558c608c851a1846e.poster.avif?t=1746567941\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1763220/extras/acc5ad3421b2d8b558c608c851a1846e.webm?t=1746567941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1763220/extras/acc5ad3421b2d8b558c608c851a1846e.mp4?t=1746567941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Procedurally generated platforming levels</strong>, a new adventure every time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge tough <strong>bosses</strong> at the end of each zone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect <strong>Pieces of Mind</strong> and spend them between levels to <strong>increase your stats</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1763220/extras/c0b494aed266315623a7d989d08c734f.poster.avif?t=1746567941\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1763220/extras/c0b494aed266315623a7d989d08c734f.gif?t=1746567941\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock <strong>new weapons</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1763220/extras/8510ebb357852534d44860eec7558967.poster.avif?t=1746567941\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1763220/extras/8510ebb357852534d44860eec7558967.webm?t=1746567941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1763220/extras/8510ebb357852534d44860eec7558967.mp4?t=1746567941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as <strong>Camellia</strong>, a <strong>nonconventional princess</strong>, heiress to the throne, who has to fulfill multitude obligations, due to her rank.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Camelia evolves in <strong>two dimensions</strong>: <br>the world of her <strong>Palace</strong>, and the <strong>ethereal world</strong> that can be accessed by practicing\u00a0<strong>\u201cDerivation\u201d</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u201cDerivation\u201d is a kind\u00a0of meditation</strong>,\u00a0which helps her solve problems when\u00a0she returns to the real world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The meditation is\u00a0a <strong>side scrolling\u00a0action game</strong>,\u00a0where <strong>levels</strong>, <strong>weapons</strong> and <strong>enemies</strong> are <strong>procedurally generated</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1763220/extras/f8ed2cae44fe4e7b3e681707a5e1042b.poster.avif?t=1746567941\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1763220/extras/f8ed2cae44fe4e7b3e681707a5e1042b.webm?t=1746567941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1763220/extras/f8ed2cae44fe4e7b3e681707a5e1042b.mp4?t=1746567941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1763220/extras/bad1fdace45744e580e992bd5896ec67.poster.avif?t=1746567941\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1763220/extras/bad1fdace45744e580e992bd5896ec67.webm?t=1746567941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass