220/extras/acc5ad3421b2d8b558c608c851a1846e.webm?t=1746567941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1763220/extras/acc5ad3421b2d8b558c608c851a1846e.mp4?t=1746567941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Procedurally generated platforming levels</strong>, a new adventure every time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge tough <strong>bosses</strong> at the end of each zone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect <strong>Pieces of Mind</strong> and spend them between levels to <strong>increase your stats</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1763220/extras/c0b494aed266315623a7d989d08c734f.poster.avif?t=1746567941\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1763220/extras/c0b494aed266315623a7d989d08c734f.gif?t=1746567941\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock <strong>new weapons</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1763220/extras/8510ebb357852534d44860eec7558967.poster.avif?t=1746567941\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1763220/extras/8510ebb357852534d44860eec7558967.webm?t=1746567941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1763220/extras/8510ebb357852534d44860eec7558967.mp4?t=1746567941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li></ul>",
